# Files of the UI crates, lector-mcp, lector-cli and lector-agent that write files themselves
# (`fs::write`, `File::create`, `OpenOptions`, `lector_fs::write_atomic`, the confined write of
# `lector_fs::confine`) instead of going through a lector-app command (ADR 0002, ADR 0010 item 8).
# Each entry needs a reason; an entry that exempts nothing is an error.
#
# Agent writes are the known second write path of ADR 0010 ("Not decided here": saving a document
# and agent file writes are write paths beside the command registry, with their own backup and
# journal logic). They are listed so that they stay visible and are counted in the rule output.
crates/lector-agent/src/session.rs   # fs/write_text_file: confined, backed up and journaled; ADR 0010 known gap
